        "description": "Increased interpupillary distance (hypertelorism) confirmed by clinical measurement",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "facial-dysmorphism",
        "description": "Additional facial dysmorphic features such as broad nasal bridge and prominent forehead",
